            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Moleculin Biotech announces issuance of Canadian patent covering Annamycin",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Moleculin Biotech (MBRX) announced that the Canadian Intellectual Property Office, CIPO, has issued a notice of allowance for Patent Application No. 3,142,510 titled, \u201cPREPARATION OF PRELIPOSOMAL ANNAMYCIN LYOPHILIZATE.\u201d A patent from the application is expected to be issued in the coming months. When issued, the patent claims will cover methods of making a preliposomal Annamycin lyophilizate with improved stability and high purity, with a base patent term currently extending until June 2040, su",
